  "details": "1. Go to my world https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ee7df9fc-007f-4541-beed-3c5d38c7784f (which has scaled movement that lets you run fast relative to your size)\n\n2. Scale yourself above 50 m.\n\n3. Run while looking down.\n\n4. Adjust things until you see the cursor.\n\nIt seems to scale with your speed and direction of looking.\n\nOnly tried on desktop.\n\nFPS has some effect but I'm not sure.\n\nCamera near distance doesn't seem to matter.\n\nThe lower the FOV is, the more likely it will happen.\n\nThe faster you move, the more likely it will happen.\n\nCan happen in other worlds too if you can run fast enough.",
